setup_notes.content:
Set the plugin as the VAD engine in the OpenVoiceOS configuration:

{
  "listener": {
    "VAD": {
      "module": "ovos-vad-plugin-webrtcvad",
      "ovos-vad-plugin-webrtcvad": {
        "vad_mode": 3
      }
    }
  }
}

`vad_mode` ranges from 0 (least aggressive) to 3 (most aggressive, default).
